        {
          "id": "S002",
          "text": "Choose w∈W0 with w≠0 from F001. Evaluating ∑_j G0_jj=Id_U0 at w yields ∑_j G0_jj w=w. If every term were zero, the sum would be zero, contradicting w≠0. Thus there exists j∈Fin(n0) with G0_jj w≠0.",
